      en: ["The palace was originally built in 1730 at the behest of Governor de Cheusses.", "It is the official office of the President of Suriname.", "The building is constructed of white-painted Surinamese hardwood.", "The palace is part of the core zone of the UNESCO World Heritage site of Paramaribo.", "The wooden upper floor was added only in the year 1780.", "Behind the palace stretches the famous Royal Palm Garden."],
