      en: ["The National Assembly was officially inaugurated in 2009.", "The building is located on the reclaimed island of Ile du Port.", "It was built with financial assistance from the Chinese government.", "It houses the 35 members of the country's unicameral legislature.", "The construction was carried out by the Qingjian International Group.", "It symbolizes the transition to a modern multi-party democracy."],
