      en: ["The monument honors Djibouti's independence achieved on June 27, 1977.", "It is located in the government district near the Place du 27 Juin.", "The design symbolizes the unity between the Afar and Issa ethnic groups.", "The site serves as a central venue for annual independence day celebrations.", "It is situated in close proximity to the Presidential Palace of Djibouti.", "The monument is a key landmark in the urban landscape of the capital."],
